{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Eb]You made the [Gm]Earth and the [F]heavens.
[Eb]Spoke words to [Gm]form them and [F]fill them.
[Eb]So all that we [Gm]have is by [F]Your hand.
[Gm]Gracious and [F/A]holy You [Eb/Bb]are.
[Eb]You gave us [Gm]freedom and [F]purpose.
[Eb]We chose re[Gm]bellion and [F]curses.
[Eb]But hope lingered [Gm]under the [F]surface.
[Gm]Gracious and [F/A]holy You [Eb/Bb]are.
[Gm]Gracious and [F/A]holy You [Bb]are.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
You are [Eb]here, always with [Gm]me,
Nearer than [Bb]sacred to naked should [F/A]be.
You speak [Eb]promises over my [Gm]shame.
[Bb]I know that [Cm]I'll never [F]be the [Bb]same.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Eb]You came to [Gm]dwell with Your [F]people;
[Eb]Strengthen the [Gm]downcast and [F]feeble;
[Eb]And rescue us [Gm]from every [F]evil.
[Gm]Gracious and [F/A]holy You [Eb/Bb]are.
[Eb]Humbly you [Gm]gave Your life [F]for us.
[Eb]Hope is re[Gm]versing our [F]curses,
[Eb]Restoring our [Gm]freedom and [F]purpose.
[Gm]Gracious and [F/A]holy You [Eb/Bb]are.
[Gm]Gracious and [F/A]holy You [Bb]are.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus 2}
You are [Eb]here, always with [Gm]me.
Nearer than [Bb]righteous to wretched should [F/A]be.
You speak [Eb]promises over my [Gm]shame.
[Bb]I know that [Cm]I'll never [F]be the [Bb]same.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Eb]Now you are [Gm]seated in [F]Heaven,
[Eb]So, by the [Gm]Spirit You've [F]given,
[Eb]We will pro[Gm]claim, "Christ is [F]risen!"
[Gm]Gracious and [F/A]holy You [Eb/Bb]are.
[Gm]Gracious and [F/A]holy You [Bb]are.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus 3}
[Bb]You are [Eb]here, always with [Gm]me,
Nearer for[Bb]ever than failure could [F/A]be.
You poured [Eb]righteousness over my [Gm]shame.
Called me Your [Bb]child and then gave me Your [F/A]name.
You are [Eb]here, always with [Gm]me,
Nearer for[Bb]ever than failure could [F/A]be.
You poured [Eb]righteousness over my [Gm]shame.
[Bb]I know that [Cm]I'll never [F]be the [Bb]same.
[Gm]I know that [Cm]I'll never [F]be the [Bb]same.
{end_of_chorus}
